    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "As a minimum your Brief should include:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Your Brief"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "Key Requirements\tWhat do you want? Detail the timescales Technical specifications Statement of work Budget.\nOutputs\tExamples may be: Temporary staff Site landscaping\nHow bids will be evaluated\tInclude your evaluation criteria and weightings. These should be communicated to all potential bidders.\nContract Management\tHow you are going to manage the contract when it goes live (does anything need to be added to the brief to reflect this?) How will quality or service levels be measured, recorded and maintained? What information should the bidder provide? Costs: how do you keep them from rising? How will issues be rectified? Where and how are deliveries made? How will processes be improved? Etc.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Your Brief"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {
        "rows": [
          [
