        "Data Protection Regulations (DPR)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00043",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Organisations should ensure that all relevant procurement documents make reference to the Data Protection Regulations (DPR) and update their terms and conditions accordingly.",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "heading_path": [
        "Your Brief",
        "Data Protection Regulations (DPR)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00044",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you are in any doubt you should seek legal advice/speak to your Procurement department or your Centre of Expertise (CoE) to help finalise your brief and ensure your ITQ as well as any other documentation that you issue is DPR compliant",
      "ordinal": 44,
      "heading_path": [
        "Your Brief",
        "Data Protection Regulations (DPR)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
